ModulePaperlessName=Paperless-ngx integration
ModulePaperlessDesc=Archive linked PDF uploads in Paperless-ngx and keep a Dolibarr link to the document
ModulePaperlessDescLong=Routes PDF uploads from Dolibarr linked-document pages to Paperless-ngx. Dolibarr stores a link instead of a second local PDF copy.
Paperless=Paperless-ngx
PaperlessSetup=Paperless-ngx integration setup
PaperlessSetupIntro=Configure the server-side Paperless-ngx API connection. PDF-only uploads from Dolibarr document tabs can then be archived in Paperless-ngx and represented in Dolibarr as linked URLs.
PAPERLESS_API_URL=Paperless API base URL
PAPERLESS_API_URL_HELP=Base URL reachable from the Dolibarr PHP server, for example https://paperless.example.com. Do not add /api to the end.
PAPERLESS_WEB_URL=Paperless browser URL
PAPERLESS_WEB_URL_HELP=URL users should open in their browser. Leave empty when it is the same as the API base URL.
PAPERLESS_API_TOKEN=Paperless API token
PAPERLESS_API_TOKEN_HELP=Token used by Dolibarr for server-side REST API calls. It is never sent to the user's browser.
PAPERLESS_TAG_NAME=Paperless tag name
PAPERLESS_TAG_NAME_HELP=Paperless tag automatically applied to documents uploaded from Dolibarr. Default: dolibarr. If the tag does not exist, the module attempts to create it. Leave empty to disable automatic tagging.
PAPERLESS_REDIRECT_PDF_UPLOADS=Archive PDF uploads in Paperless
PAPERLESS_REDIRECT_PDF_UPLOADS_HELP=When enabled, PDF-only submissions on linked-document pages are uploaded to Paperless instead of being stored locally by Dolibarr.
PAPERLESS_INVOICE_MATCHING_ENABLED=Enable invoice matching
PAPERLESS_INVOICE_MATCHING_ENABLED_HELP=Adds a Billing / Payment menu that searches existing Paperless documents by invoice number and links unambiguous matches to Dolibarr invoices.
PAPERLESS_HTTP_TIMEOUT=API HTTP timeout (seconds)
PAPERLESS_HTTP_TIMEOUT_HELP=Maximum time allowed for a single HTTP request from Dolibarr to Paperless.
PAPERLESS_RESOLVE_WAIT=Link resolver wait time (seconds)
PAPERLESS_RESOLVE_WAIT_HELP=How long a click on a newly queued link may wait for Paperless consumption to complete before showing a processing page. Maximum 30 seconds.
PaperlessSameAsApiUrl=Leave empty to use the API URL
PaperlessApiVersionInfo=The integration requests Paperless REST API version 10.
PaperlessNotConfigured=Paperless-ngx integration is enabled but the API URL or API token is not configured.
PaperlessMissingObjectContext=The Dolibarr object context required to create the linked file could not be determined.
PaperlessMixedUploadFallback=A PDF and another file type were selected together. To avoid partial routing, this mixed upload will use Dolibarr's normal local file handling. Upload PDFs separately to archive them in Paperless.
PaperlessUploadPhpError=Upload of %s failed before Paperless processing (PHP upload error %s).
PaperlessInvalidPdf=%s has a .pdf extension but does not contain a valid PDF signature.
PaperlessUploadFailed=Could not upload %s to Paperless-ngx: %s
PaperlessLinkCreateFailed=%s was submitted to Paperless, but the Dolibarr link could not be created. Paperless task ID: %s
PaperlessUploadQueued=%s was submitted to Paperless-ngx. Dolibarr stored it as a linked document.
PaperlessTagUnavailable=Paperless tag %s could not be used: %s. The document upload will continue without the tag.
PaperlessInvalidTaskId=The Paperless consumption task identifier is invalid.
PaperlessDocumentUnavailable=Paperless document unavailable
PaperlessDocumentProcessing=Paperless is still processing this document
PaperlessDocumentProcessingHelp=The document has been accepted by Paperless-ngx but consumption/OCR has not finished yet. This page will try again automatically.
PaperlessInvoiceMatcherMenu=Paperless invoice matching
PaperlessInvoiceMatcher=Paperless invoice matching
PaperlessInvoiceMatcherIntro=Search existing Paperless-ngx documents by Dolibarr invoice number and create native linked-document entries.
PaperlessInvoiceKind=Invoice type
PaperlessCustomerInvoices=Customer invoices
PaperlessSupplierInvoices=Supplier invoices
PaperlessLookbackDays=Look-back days
PaperlessInvoiceLimit=Maximum invoices
PaperlessScanAndLink=Search and link unique matches
PaperlessInvoiceMatcherSafety=Automatic association is only performed when exactly one Paperless document contains the complete invoice number, allowing only separator differences. Ambiguous results are left for manual review.
PaperlessSearchReference=Search reference
PaperlessAlreadyLinked=Already linked
PaperlessAutoLinked=Linked automatically
PaperlessAmbiguousMatches=%s exact matches - review required
PaperlessNoExactMatch=No unique exact match
PaperlessNoMatch=No Paperless match
PaperlessNoInvoiceReference=No invoice number
PaperlessSkippedAfterApiError=Skipped after Paperless API error
PaperlessNotScanned=Not searched yet
PaperlessLinkThis=Link this
PaperlessInvoiceLinkFailed=Could not link invoice %s: %s
PaperlessInvoiceLinked=Invoice %s linked to Paperless.
PaperlessInvoiceMatchingDisabled=Paperless invoice matching is disabled in module setup.
